        "TileImage": "$($repository 6dcc738b-8249-4ffc-8f0e-575a6668215b).Image",
        "Description": "You&apos;ve booked a luxury hotel to get away from all that noise around you all the time! How nice!\r\rBut what&apos;s this? A band taking over the entire hotel??? Are you serious? This is outrageous, you think, them making a noise when you&apos;re just trying to rest! How about you go up there and give those band guys a piece of your mind?\r\rRemember, this isn&apos;t about just the targets, you&apos;re trying to kill everyone on the map.\r\rGood luck, 40",
